{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23574","headline":"岁暮寄微之三首 二 · 白居易","name":"岁暮寄微之三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"荣进虽频退亦频，与君才命不调匀。\n若不九重中掌事，即须千里外抛身。\n紫垣南北厅曾对，沧海东西郡又邻。\n唯欠结庐嵩洛下，一时归去作闲人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23574.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23574","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}